# What the formatter must never touch (task 003).
#
# Two layers say what is in scope, on purpose: the gate stage passes the glob **/*.{ts,tsx}, and
# this file holds the line even if someone widens that glob later. The glob alone is one edit away
# from sweeping the whole repo.
#
# 🔴 MARKDOWN IS EXCLUDED ON PURPOSE — DO NOT "HELPFULLY" WIDEN THIS.
# Nearly every .md in this repo is Thai prose written by hand: REQUIREMENTS.md, the task cards
# under tasks/, the knowledge cards under .docs/knowledge/. CLAUDE.md §2.5 says existing Thai
# content is not to be rewritten, and a markdown formatter rewrites it wholesale — it reflows
# paragraphs, renormalises table pipes and moves list markers. On Thai text that is not a
# formatting change anyone can review: Thai has no word spaces, so a reflowed line breaks in a
# different place than the author chose, and the diff is unreadable. The cost is real and the
# benefit is zero, because prose has no compiler that cares.
*.md

